cmd (["C20":({4,"*>[say] Indeed.",}),"A51":({6,"moveto %s","query_Omas_location",}),"C43":({8,"cue oma C5",}),"C01":({2,"cue Oma C1",}),"D81":({2,"moveto +1+6+0",}),"C40":({8,"*>[say] Voman, vill you hush for a moment? Listen to vhat I discovered in zhe library - it vas written by Paracelsus himself.",}),"A71":({4,"moveto %s","victim_not_here",}),"ZZ0":({0,}),"C21":({6,"expressions: read *>[say] Archdoxis X",}),"A52":({4,"expressions yawn *>[say] Yes, vhat is it voman, zhat you must vake an old man from his nap?",}),"C60":({8,"expressions: read *>[say] While the traditional safeguards against these beasts have sometimes been effective, they are seldom reliable. To ensure certain success against the stalking beast, one must think and sense just as they. To this end, the hunter himself must symbolically consume the liquid life source...",}),"D82":({6,"cue oma D9",}),"CA0":({12,}),"A72":({2,"cue oma A8",}),"C41":({12,"expressions: read *>[say] Vampyres: On the subject of these devilish creatures I have made a  discovery of great importance. Utilizing the works of Kuritsinn, as well as those of Beheim and Sadovianu I began to discover the real life of the Voivode...",}),"C80":({6,"*>[say] No... now shhh! It says 'Inhalation of the plasma-based Yliastrum elixir provides greatly enhanced perception to the hunter. It will tax the stamina, but prove invaluable in such matters.",}),"A53":({10,"cue oma A6",}),"C22":({6,"cue oma C3",}),"D60":({2,"moveto %s","query_Juniors_location",}),"C61":({12,"cue oma C7",}),"A50":({5,"*>[say] Hmmm... yes, yes... I'm going.",}),"C42":({8,"mumble",}),"C00":({0,"moveto +1+6+0",}),"D80":({4,"expressions: mumble *>[say] Hmmph! Doesn't look like zhere's enough here for zhat...",}),"C81":({12,"cue oma C9",}),"A70":({4,"expressions: scoff *>[say] Hmphh...",}),"D61":({4,"cue oma D7",}),])
